            <ArticleTitle>A year of chronic TMPDS: evaluating patients' pain patterns.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>53-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In 136 women with TMPDS observed for one year, pain was highly variable. No respondent had a consistent pattern of pain increase or decrease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
